"P1743682643" "Thank you, {Rescuer}. I'll go out to the relief station and help others."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P4215260313" "I heard Paragon City was exciting, {Rescuer}, but I think I've had enough excitement for a while!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2143509581" "You were able to accomplish your goals and stopped the Rikti's fight on the streets."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4221075932" "Despite your best efforts, the battle between the Rikti raged on the streets of Paragon City for some time."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P689900818" "Thanks to your swift intervention, civilian casualties were low and we were able to determine that the Rikti were performing some sort of large-scale measurement. We were unable to determine what they were measuring.<br><br>I am disturbed that the forces brought to bear in what seems to have been an internecine struggle were powerful enough to challenge you. The Rikti way is one of monolithic harmony. What could cause such a schism among them?"
// RandomFameString :
"P4019559532" "I saw the battle and thought it was another Rikti Invasion. Then I saw you, {HeroName}, and I knew it would be all right."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1506322807" "The Rikti were contained in the end. We do not know why the factions were fighting or what the experiment they were conducting was. Many civilians were able to escape, but it is unknown whether any perished. <br><br>I am disturbed that the forces brought to bear in what seems to have been an internecine struggle were powerful enough to halt you. The Rikti way is one of monolithic harmony. What could cause such a schism among them?"
// RandomFameString :
"P571989764" "I heard about the Rikti fighting each other. When someone with your power can't stop them, what hope do we have?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Rikti1_Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2204996024" "Portal Corporation scientists have monitored an unauthorized interdimensional transit from our world to a nearby alternate Earth. Readings match the dimensional jump technology that the Rikti recently stole from Portal Corporation, but show signs of modification that match some of the changes made to the Portal apparatus recovered after your recent battle with the Rikti on the city streets. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I have been authorized by my superiors to request your assistance to prevent the Rikti from achieving their aims on an alternate Earth, whatever those aims may be.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1384886227" "Prevent the Rikti from achieving their aims on an alternate Earth"
// SendOffString :
"P2591180051" "I are uncertain of the Rikti's aims. The modifications to their portal generation equipment indicates that they may not be attempting a breakthrough to our home Earth, but may be performing some other operation. It is still important to alter their portal generation equipment to ensure that that world is cut off from the Rikti home Earth."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3453778457" "Disrupt Rikti portal devices"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1613741262" "Though I am uncertain of the Rikti's final objective on that world, it is imperative that you make certain that their portal generation devices are disrupted, cutting that world off from the Rikti's home Earth."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1154642823" "It looks as though this world has seen more than its share of war."

