"P1089894530" "I will: Do Honor: Lineage of War"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1848735316" "I have become: Rikti! {HeroName}: Past usefulness!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P502445921" "citizens to rescue"
// SingularDescription :
"P2023654776" "Rescue the last citizen!"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P440525556" "Wow, {Rescuer}, you're a sight for sore eyes"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P176921371" "That was an incredible save, {Rescuer}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P2874764193" "Who tha hero? You tha hero, {Rescuer}! You tha hero!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1943748607" "You captured Nen'Kulf, the converted human who had first informed you of the growing schism amongst the Rikti."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1090935744" "Thank you for your assistance in this operation. With Nen'Kulf's capture we may be able to get some answers, but his mindset is very Rikti now, and very hostile. Any interrogation will be difficult. In contrast, C'Kelkah has been open and willing to talk. I will tell you more of what has been learned from her soon, once it has been cleared. <br><br>Nen'Kulf was a friend of mine, once. He believed strongly in the Rikti ideals of unity and harmony. The changes to him are disturbing, but not completely unexpected. Many who seek to impose peace can become tyrants if they follow their ideals without question."
// RandomFameString :
"P3844540969" "I've been hearing that a lot of Rikti troops used to be members of the Lost. Is that true, {HeroName}?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Rikti1_Mission6 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3903780428" "There has been an unforeseen development in the Rikti situation. The Rikti leader you captured, C'Kelkah, has been abducted by a Nemesis task force. Several guards and prisoners were killed in the attack, including one of C'Kelkah's interrogators and Nen'Kulf. It is not believed that they were specific targets of the operation. Attempts to track the movements of the Nemesis troops who captured C'Kelkah have failed. However, there have been reports of Rikti attacks on a suspected Nemesis base. It is my belief that they are trying to rescue C'Kelkah. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I am using my own authority during this emergency situation and authorizing an action to recapture C'Kelkah from Nemesis Army forces.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1568399857" "Recapture C'Kelkah from the Nemesis Army"
// SendOffString :
"P3193685397" "I do not know what purpose Nemesis or the Nemesis Army have for abducting C'Kelkah, but I am certain that we cannot allow her to remain in Nemesis' control. I have given you the coordinates where the battles between the Rikti and Nemesis have been reported. Your goal: Free C'Kelkah <br><br>Excuse me. <br><br>Your goal is to locate and liberate C'Kelkah from the Nemesis Army. Continued attacks by Rikti forces are also highly likely."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1308416561" "Locate C'Kelkah"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P351171701" "Your goal is to locate and liberate C'Kelkah from the Nemesis Army. Continued attacks by Rikti forces are also highly likely."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1110738740" "Hidden beneath a disused facade, you find nothing less than a base used by the forces of the Prussian Prince of Automatons, Nemesis!"

