"P2648629060" "Interruption source: {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - TechMachine1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2784195976" "As you adjusted one of the portal devices to seal this world off from the Rikti HomeEarth, you noticed the strange readings it was displaying."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - TechMachine2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - TechMachine3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3079854131" "You have prevented the Rikti from reaching their home world."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4271818964" "As readings from the Rikti expedition indicate and I had suspected, the Rikti believe that the barrier sealing of their homeworld is magical in nature. The Omega team that shut down the Rikti/Earth portal was comprised mostly of mystically gifted heroes. None of the ones who traveled to Rikti Earth returned, but the portal was destroyed and Rikti Earth sealed off. If the barrier around the Rikti homeworld is of a magical origin, it would explain why it has not been breached from either side. <br><br>The decrypted plans you captured on the Restructurist leader Lu'Bew were shown to the Traditionalist leader C'Kelkah. Her reaction was characterized as 'extreme.' Coupled with our knowledge that the Rikti now possess mages from transformed Lost with Mu blood, the final phase of this operation becomes apparent. I will have more information for you shortly. This will be over soon."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Rikti1_Mission12 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1017229428" "The Rikti have staged a major attack, securing a section of Oranbega rich in stores of magical energy. I believe, and C'Kelkah concurs, that they are going to utilize their magi and knowledge about magical barriers to focus that energy and use it to destroy the barrier around the Rikti home Earth, beginning a second Rikti Invasion. This cannot be allowed to happen. Conventional forces are being gathered, but they may be too late and insufficient to the task. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I therefore must ask you to disrupt the Rikti Restructurist's plans and prevent a second Rikti Invasion.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P2865962612" "Disrupt the Rikti Restructurist's plans and prevent a second Rikti Invasion"
// SendOffString :
"P2148122548" "I have consulted with all the occult and technological experts available. There should be two ways to prevent the destruction of the barrier. First, simply defeat all the Rikti in the target area. Secondly, disrupt the Rikti dimensional devices and the Circle's energy storage shrines and altars. Neither will likely be easy. Both Rikti and Circle forces are certain to regard you as a threat. You must not fail. I have absolute faith in your abilities."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3456799857" "Prevent a second Rikti Invasion"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3637546525" "There should be two ways to prevent the destruction of the barrier. First, simply defeat all the Rikti in the target area. Secondly, disrupt the Rikti dimensional devices and the Circle's energy storage shrines and altars."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P118822838" "This is where the road ends. You now must stop the Rikti in this last desperate battle or face a second invasion of the Earth. Already you can hear the sounds of battles being fought ahead in the darkness."

